s - equalPairs + mod) % mod;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        \n        System.out.println(total % mod);\n    }\n    \n    private static void generatePermutations(int[] perm, boolean[] used, int pos, int n, ArrayList<int[]> result) {\n        if (pos == n) {\n            result.add(perm.clone());\n            return;\n        }\n        \n        for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n            if (!used[i]) {\n                perm[pos] = i;\n                used[i] = true;\n                generatePermutations(perm, used, pos + 1, n, result);\n                used[i] = false;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private static boolean isLexSmaller(int[] p, int[] q) {\n        for (int i = 0; i < p.length; i++) {\n            if (p[i] < q[i]) return true;\n            if (p[i] > q[i]) return false;\n        }\n        return false;\n    }\n    \n    private static int countInversions(int[] arr) {\n        int count = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {\n            for (int j = i + 1; j < arr.length; j++) {\n                if (arr[i] > arr[j]) count++;\n            }\n        }\n        return count;\n    }\n}\n</repaired_code>\n<confidence>\n0.3\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-5.960462772236497e-07, -3.4450891689630225e-05, -1.5497195136049413e-06, 0.0, -0.00011848701251437888, -2.5629668016335927e-05, -0.0011749514378607273, -0.21866807341575623, -4.0531076592742465e-06, -4.291525328881107e-06, -1.883488948806189e-05, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.05788562446832657, -3.909988299710676e-05, -7.748573807475623e-06, -1.3112935448589269e-05, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.007744525093585253, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -2.9802276912960224e-06, -2.861018856492592e-06, -0.006018965505063534, -3.576278118089249e-07, -1.6689286894688848e-06, -4.136476854910143e-05, -5.125986263010418e-06, -1.2993727978027891e-05, -0.0015049570938572288, -5.960446742392378e-06, -0.0002112165529979393, -4.887569048150908e-06, -1.2159273865108844e-05, -2.62